Package: chatcache
Type: Package
Title: Persistent Cache for Ellmer and Shinychat LLM Interactions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shekhar", email = "skrchalwadicg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a persistent SQLite-based cache for user prompts and LLM
    responses in applications built with the 'ellmer' and 'shinychat' packages.
    Reduces API costs and latency by storing and retrieving identical or similar
    chat interactions across sessions and users.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    DBI,
    RSQLite,
    cli,
    rlang (>= 1.1.0)
Suggests: 
    ellmer,
    shiny,
    shinychat,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
